  "answer_text": "**Lucas Adams** currently plays Noah Newman on *The Young and the Restless*. Lucas Adams joined *The Young and the Restless* in November 2025 as Noah Newman, the prodigal son of Sharon (Sharon Case) and Nick Newman (Joshua Morrow).\n\nHe is well known to television audiences for his seven-year run as \"Tripp Johnson\" on *Days of Our Lives*, for which he received two Daytime Emmy nominations.\n\nThe role of Noah Newman has been played by several actors over the years:\n- **Kevin Schmidt** was the first actor to play Noah after the character was aged, appearing from 2008 to September 2010.\n- **Luke Kleintank** briefly took over before Schmidt was rehired, and then **Robert Adamson** held the role from 2012 until his departure in 2018.\n- **Rory Gibson** debuted in the role in 2021 and made his last appearance in April 2023, when Noah left Genoa City and moved to London.\n- The character returned in 2025 with **Lucas Adams** assuming the role, with Adams first appearing on November 4.",
